# Vercel deployment exclusions — uses .gitignore-style patterns.
#
# IMPORTANT: Vercel's .vercelignore uses gitignore-style patterns, not
# Docker-style. That means `upload/` matches ANY directory named `upload`
# ANYWHERE in the tree — including our route handler at
# src/app/api/brand-assets/[brandSlug]/upload/ which we MUST deploy.
# To exclude only the top-level /upload/ folder (legacy asset storage),
# we anchor the pattern with a leading slash so it only matches paths
# at the repository root.

/upload/
/download/
/tool-results/
/skills/
scripts/extract_*
*.log
README.md
brand-book-expertise.md
